        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='position:relative;width:3360px;height:860px;background:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui'><div style='position:absolute;left:60px;top:44px;font:700 15px system-ui;letter-spacing:0.16em;color:#6d28d9'>NAVIGATION · SMOKE TEST</div><div style='position:absolute;left:60px;top:74px;font:400 44px Georgia,serif'>Five nodes in a sequence</div><div style='position:absolute;left:60px;top:140px;width:1500px;font:400 19px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'>Click a node three times: the camera comes to it, it takes focus, you are inside. Click an edge three times: both ends are framed, it is selected, you travel to the far end. Follow a port to the next node. Escape steps out. Back retraces every move. The two Portals at the top right go through: three clicks, or a double-click. Back returns you to the Portal you left by.</div></div>"
        }
      },
      "positionLocked": true
    },
